    "http": "# v1 API — Generated from OpenAPI spec\n\n@host = http://localhost/api\n@token = Bearer {{token}}\n\n### Create an entity\nPOST {{host}}/v1/users/create\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n    \"email\": \"\",\n    \"age\": 0\n}\n\n### Update an entity\nPOST {{host}}/v1/users/update\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n    \"id\": 0,\n    \"email\": \"\",\n    \"age\": 0\n}\n\n### Search entities\nGET {{host}}/v1/users/search?page=&email=&age=\n\n### Show an entity\nGET {{host}}/v1/users/show?id=\n\n### The historical form: no context, a list of lines\nPOST {{host}}/v1/users/legacy\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nname=&count=\n\n### Scalars by name rather than the object\nPOST {{host}}/v1/users/scalars\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nmarker=\n\n### Create an entity\nPOST {{host}}/v1/posts/create\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n    \"title\": \"\",\n    \"status\": \"\"\n}\n\n### Update an entity\nPOST {{host}}/v1/posts/update\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n    \"id\": 0,\n    \"title\": \"\",\n    \"status\": \"\"\n}\n\n### Search entities\nGET {{host}}/v1/posts/search?page=&title=&status=\n\n### Show an entity\nGET {{host}}/v1/posts/show?id=\n\n### The historical form: no context, a list of lines\nPOST {{host}}/v1/posts/legacy\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nname=&count=\n\n### Scalars by name rather than the object\nPOST {{host}}/v1/posts/scalars\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nmarker=\n",
    "markdown": "# Context API\nOne generic controller serving several entities, each with its own fields (v1)\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost/api`\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [users](#users)\n- [posts](#posts)\n\n## users\n\n### Create an entity\n\n`POST /v1/users/create`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/json`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `email` | string | Yes |  |\n| `age` | integer | No |  |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Update an entity\n\n`POST /v1/users/update`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/json`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `id` | integer | Yes | Identifier |\n| `email` | string | No |  |\n| `age` | integer | No |  |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Search entities\n\n`GET /v1/users/search`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `page` | integer | No | Page |\n| `email` | string | No |  |\n| `age` | integer | No |  |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Show an entity\n\n`GET /v1/users/show`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `id` | integer | Yes | Identifier |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### The historical form: no context, a list of lines\n\n`POST /v1/users/legacy`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | string | Yes | Name |\n| `count` | integer | No | Count |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Scalars by name rather than the object\n\n`POST /v1/users/scalars`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `marker` | string | Yes | v1|users|scalars|post|spicy|default|scalars |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n## posts\n\n### Create an entity\n\n`POST /v1/posts/create`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/json`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `title` | string | Yes |  |\n| `status` | string | Yes |  |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Update an entity\n\n`POST /v1/posts/update`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/json`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `id` | integer | Yes | Identifier |\n| `title` | string | No |  |\n| `status` | string | No |  |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Search entities\n\n`GET /v1/posts/search`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `page` | integer | No | Page |\n| `title` | string | No |  |\n| `status` | string | No |  |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Show an entity\n\n`GET /v1/posts/show`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `id` | integer | Yes | Identifier |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### The historical form: no context, a list of lines\n\n`POST /v1/posts/legacy`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | string | Yes | Name |\n| `count` | integer | No | Count |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Scalars by name rather than the object\n\n`POST /v1/posts/scalars`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `marker` | string | Yes | v1|posts|scalars|post|spicy|default|scalars |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n",
    "curl": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Context API\nOne generic controller serving several entities, each with its own fields (v1) — cURL examples\n# Auto-generated from OpenAPI spec. Do not edit manually.\n\nBASE_URL=\"http://localhost/api\"\nTOKEN=\"${API_TOKEN:-}\"\n\n# Create an entity\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"email\":\"\",\"age\":0}' \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/users/create\"\n\n# Update an entity\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"id\":0,\"email\":\"\",\"age\":0}' \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/users/update\"\n\n# Search entities\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/users/search?page=&email=&age=\"\n\n# Show an entity\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/users/show?id=\"\n\n# The historical form: no context, a list of lines\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"name=\" \\\n  -d \"count=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/users/legacy\"\n\n# Scalars by name rather than the object\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"marker=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/users/scalars\"\n\n# Create an entity\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"title\":\"\",\"status\":\"\"}' \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/posts/create\"\n\n# Update an entity\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"id\":0,\"title\":\"\",\"status\":\"\"}' \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/posts/update\"\n\n# Search entities\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/posts/search?page=&title=&status=\"\n\n# Show an entity\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/posts/show?id=\"\n\n# The historical form: no context, a list of lines\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"name=\" \\\n  -d \"count=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/posts/legacy\"\n\n# Scalars by name rather than the object\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"marker=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/posts/scalars\"\n",
